  "boundary": "This plan prepares an exact-source repository-local review surface for a real assistive-technology session against the frozen V1.6 source. The harness cannot determine that a screen reader or other assistive technology was used, cannot mark the Assistive Technology lane passed, and cannot create canonical evidence. Accepted evidence requires a real reviewer session with exact-source identity, environment metadata, observations, limitations, and a durable evidence reference."
